# SDD Codex Protocol Pack

This package separates project governance from operational protocols.

-   [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md): navigation, authority and global rules.
-   [`Protocol 01`](protocols/01-ENVIRONMENT-AND-TOOLS.md): technical environment and installations.
-   [`Protocol 02`](protocols/02-DOCUMENT-INGESTION-AND-STORAGE.md): ingestion, classification and storage.
-   [`Protocol 03`](protocols/03-FIGMA-CONSTRUCTION.md): Figma MCP construction.
-   [`Protocol 04`](protocols/04-SELF-DOCUMENTATION-AND-TRACEABILITY.md): persistent self-documentation and traceability.
-   [`Protocol 05`](protocols/05-QA-AND-VALIDATION.md): QA and validation.
-   [`Protocol 06`](protocols/06-GRAPH-SELF-DOCUMENTATION.md): graph self-documentation and knowledge maintenance.

